+    {"id":"beat-03-genuinely","start":18.65,"duration":25.35,"text":"Notice the word genuinely. Not everything is portable. Some things belong to the old context, and it's okay to leave them there. But here's what most career changers get wrong: the honest inventory is longer than they realize. You've built more that travels than you think — and building that list explicitly is one of the single highest-leverage exercises in this whole track."},
