+    {"id":"beat-08-perspective","start":91.65,"duration":19.35,"text":"And fourth: Insights and Perspective — what you see that others don't. Ask: what patterns did I learn in my last field that would be non-obvious in a new one? That outsider's eye is something people who've spent their whole career in one place simply don't have."},
+    {"id":"beat-09-work-list","start":111.65,"duration":12.35,"text":"So work the list, one category at a time. What you can do that translates. What you care about that carries. Who travels with you. What you see that others don't."},
+    {"id":"beat-10-carry-forward","start":124.65,"duration":20.55,"text":"This isn't nostalgia — it's an asset count. And we'd put money on yours being longer than you expect. When you can see in one place what genuinely comes with you, your next chapter stops feeling like starting from zero. Because you're not starting from zero. You're carrying forward."}
+  ]
+}
